{
  "_comment": [
    "Pages screenshotted by .github/workflows/visual-inspection.yml.",
    "scripts/visual/build-site-pages-json.js appends the latest article and post,",
    "so detail views for those two collections need no entry here.",
    "scripts/test/test-visual-inspection-pages.rb checks every url resolves.",
    "The harness (scripts/visual/take-screenshots.js) takes only { id, name, url },",
    "navigates once and captures fullPage at 1440x1200. It cannot seed",
    "localStorage or emulate prefers-color-scheme, so every capture is the",
    "default light palette; dark mode has to be reviewed by hand until the",
    "harness grows a theme option. Query strings do pass through, which is how",
    "the filtered listing states below are reached."
  ],
